{"html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Nymrel Agent — explainable multi-model routing</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Route work across models with explicit constraints, deterministic scoring, and no prompt custody. Use the free API, CLI, or MCP server.\">\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://nymrel-agent.vercel.app/\">\n  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Nymrel Agent\">\n  <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Explainable multi-model routing. Your catalog, your policies, your keys.\">\n  <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n  <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://nymrel-agent.vercel.app/\">\n  <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://nymrel-agent.vercel.app/og-image.png\">\n  <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\">\n  <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\">\n  <meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Nymrel Agent — route with evidence\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Nymrel Agent\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Explainable multi-model routing. Your catalog, your policies, your keys.\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://nymrel-agent.vercel.app/og-image.png\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:image:alt\" content=\"Nymrel Agent — route with evidence\">\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n  <link rel=\"sitemap\" type=\"application/xml\" href=\"/sitemap.xml\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/styles.css\">\n  <script src=\"/demo.js\" defer></script>\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Nymrel Agent\",\"applicationCategory\":\"DeveloperApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Cross-platform\",\"description\":\"Explainable multi-model routing through a stateless API, CLI, and MCP server.\",\"url\":\"https://nymrel-agent.vercel.app/\",\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Nymrel\",\"url\":\"https://nymrel.com\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"description\":\"The public routing endpoint is available without an account.\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header class=\"nav shell\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">N</span><span>Nymrel Agent</span></a>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Primary navigation\">\n      <a href=\"/docs\">Docs</a>\n      <a href=\"/openapi.json\">OpenAPI</a>\n      <a href=\"/downloads/v0.1.0.json\">Downloads</a>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Nymrel/nymrel-agent\">Source</a>\n      <a class=\"button small\" href=\"https://nymrel.com/brief\">Work with Nymrel</a>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <section class=\"hero shell\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">EXPLAINABLE MULTI-MODEL ROUTING</p>\n      <h1>Route with evidence.<br><span>Run where your keys already live.</span></h1>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Nymrel Agent selects a model from your catalog using explicit health, risk, capability, data-boundary, cost, and latency constraints. The public router never receives prompts or provider credentials.</p>\n      <div class=\"actions\">\n        <a class=\"button\" href=\"#live-demo\">Run the live example</a>\n        <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/docs#quickstart\">Read the quickstart <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a>\n        <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/downloads/nymrel-agent-v0.1.0-source.tar.gz\">Download the v0.1.0 source <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"proof-row\" aria-label=\"Product boundaries\">\n        <span>No account</span><span>No prompt custody</span><span>Deterministic result</span><span>Open contract</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"demo shell\" aria-labelledby=\"demo-title\">\n      <div class=\"demo-copy\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">ONE CORE, THREE SURFACES</p>\n        <h2 id=\"demo-title\">Start with an API call.<br>Keep the same decision everywhere.</h2>\n        <p>The hosted endpoint routes metadata only. The CLI can route locally. The MCP server lets compatible agents ask Nymrel Agent for the same explainable decision.</p>\n        <ul class=\"check-list\">\n          <li>Every rejected model carries stable reason codes.</li>\n          <li>Equal scores break deterministically by model and provider ID.</li>\n          <li>Your quality and reliability inputs remain your evidence—not our marketing claims.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"terminal live-terminal\" id=\"live-demo\" data-live-demo data-state=\"idle\" aria-label=\"Live routing example\">\n        <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><strong>live-route.json</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"terminal-controls\">\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"terminal-kicker\">ZERO-ACCOUNT PUBLIC ROUTE</p>\n            <p data-demo-status aria-live=\"polite\">Run the published metadata example against the live router.</p>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"button demo-run\" type=\"button\" data-run-demo>Run example</button>\n        </div>\n        <pre><code data-demo-output>{\n  \"ready\": true,\n  \"input\": \"/examples/route-request.json\",\n  \"endpoint\": \"/v1/route\"\n}</code></pre>\n        <div class=\"terminal-result-actions\">\n          <button class=\"terminal-link\" type=\"button\" data-copy-demo hidden>Copy result</button>\n          <a class=\"terminal-link\" data-demo-feedback hidden href=\"https://nymrel.com/brief?utm_source=nymrel-agent&amp;utm_medium=product&amp;utm_campaign=nymrel-agent-first-user\">I used this — send feedback <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a>\n        </div>\n        <noscript><p class=\"terminal-noscript\">JavaScript is disabled. Use the <a href=\"/docs#quickstart\">curl quickstart</a> to run the same public example.</p></noscript>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section shell\" aria-labelledby=\"why-title\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">DESIGNED FOR OPERATORS</p>\n      <h2 id=\"why-title\">A router you can disagree with.</h2>\n      <div class=\"card-grid\">\n        <article><p class=\"eyebrow\">01</p><h3>Constraints before scores</h3><p>Models that violate risk, boundary, modality, context, cost, or latency requirements are rejected before ranking.</p></article>\n        <article><p class=\"eyebrow\">02</p><h3>Visible tradeoffs</h3><p>Choose balanced, quality, cost, or latency. Component scores show exactly why the winner moved.</p></article>\n        <article><p class=\"eyebrow\">03</p><h3>Low-custody by default</h3><p>The hosted service accepts routing metadata only. Optional live execution runs locally with your own provider account.</p></article>\n        <article><p class=\"eyebrow\">04</p><h3>Receipts without bodies</h3><p>Local runs produce correlation digests, events, route facts, and usage without placing task or output text in receipts.</p></article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"boundary\">\n      <div class=\"shell split\">\n        <div><p class=\"eyebrow\">THE V0.1 BOUNDARY</p><h2>Useful now. Honest about what is next.</h2></div>\n        <div class=\"boundary-copy\"><p>The public product routes; it does not execute model calls. The local harness executes read-only requests through configured adapters. Write-capable tools, hosted provider-key custody, billing, and autonomous side effects are outside this release.</p><a class=\"text-link light\" href=\"/docs#security\">Read the security model →</a></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"service shell\" aria-labelledby=\"service-title\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">NYMREL IMPLEMENTATION SERVICE</p>\n        <h2 id=\"service-title\">Need the router fitted to a real model stack?</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <p>We configure evidence-backed model catalogs, routing policies, evals, local provider adapters, and operational receipts around your workflow. Scope and pricing are provided on request.</p>\n        <a class=\"button dark\" href=\"https://nymrel.com/brief\">Start a brief</a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer shell\">\n    <div><a class=\"brand\" href=\"https://nymrel.com\"><span class=\"mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">N</span><span>Nymrel</span></a><p>Products and services built to hold up under real use.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"footer-links\"><a href=\"/docs\">Docs</a><a href=\"/llms.txt\">llms.txt</a><a href=\"/healthz\">Status</a><a href=\"https://nymrel.com/privacy\">Privacy</a></div>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}
